# Spectra webview and previews
- Build the Cursor WebviewPanel, not a marketing website or fake signed-in dashboard.
  Use native `--vscode-*` theme tokens and accessible, readable narrow-panel layouts.
- Empty state starts with source capture; Orbit is an explicit curated sample only.
  Browser `npm run dev` is labeled Browser harness with no native source/AI capabilities.
- Label all custom-source originals AI reconstructions, not running components or screenshots.
  Show snapshot context and missing dependencies; never compile or run arbitrary React/JSX.
- Preserve ORIGINAL | A | B | C and independent interactive previews. Each variant shows
  name, causal hypothesis, concrete changes, Choose and Refine; remix uses two exact sources.
- UI selects IDs via the validated host protocol; source and variants are authoritative in host.
  No credentials, provider requests, arbitrary editor commands or file paths in the webview.
- Choose shows Original ↔ Selected. Copy for Cursor is a manual clipboard brief; Save HTML uses
  a native dialog. Neither is automatic Apply or chat/agent launch; export exact selected code.
- Use `documentFor` with the parent script nonce. Generated code runs only in `srcdoc` with
  `sandbox="allow-scripts"`, never same-origin, forms, popups or top-navigation permissions.
- Preserve parent and preview restrictive CSP, blocked network and local webview assets.
  Do not evaluate generated JS in React or host. Isolation/validation is not an absolute guarantee.
- Preserve the standalone export warning: files omit preview CSP and lose iframe isolation.
- Preserve original, previous versions, selection and recoverable instruction on failures.
  Status messages must not rebuild unchanged iframe documents or reset their controls.
- Curated sample transformations are presets, not live instruction following. No silent fallback.
  Preserve pricing and billing units; label fictional proof visibly in previews and exports.
- Support keyboard actions, visible focus, accessible labels, dialog trapping/restoration,
  announced errors, reduced motion and light/dark/high-contrast themes.
- Run build/diagnostics and relevant flow checks after changes. Harness checks do not verify
  native host commands, SecretStorage, inherited editor CSP or live provider calls.
